:"[S28T43]","raw_turn_sha256":"63b128418a0d5e6495e7e974c569114a34305cd24b0ae65ab0416f865d43d4e1","rendered_turn_sha256":"4459b41a7c0d6af3ba783434b42f8adbbd0d1d6b7f2aeb6124548c876a2512b6","session_date":"2023-11-02","session_datetime":"2023-11-02T17:46:00","session_id":"session_28","session_index":28,"source_sha256":"a8b28a870e89157d6a8e181b6b5c653a8a6c5643d90142f2afcdbdab0434719e","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":43}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-11-02, reconnected with Calvin (\"Hey Dave! It's been a while! Crazy stuff has been happening.\"): Calvin told him that last week (~2023-10-26) he threw a small party at his Japanese mansion for his new album — \"It was amazing, so much love from my fam and friends!\" — and shared a photo of the party in the mansion (a group of people sitting in a room with a projector screen) — \"it was so energizing!\"; Dave: \"Congrats on your album release and the party, Calvin! Must've been a great feeling having your loved ones show their support.\" [S28T1][S28T2]. Calvin: \"Thanks, Dave! It was an awesome feeling seeing everyone come together to celebrate - super rewarding!\" (shared a photo of a group of people dancing at the party); Dave: \"Wow, great job, Calvin! Congrats! What was it like when everyone was cheering you on?\"; Calvin: \"It was incredible, Dave! The room was buzzing with energy and love. It was a powerful reminder of why I'm doing this.\" (shared a photo of a group of people standing on top of a stage); Dave: \"Wow, Calvin! Creating something that brings people together and inspires them - that's really awesome!\"; Calvin: \"Thanks, Dave! It's an awesome feeling. Creating something that people connect with and brings joy is what I'm all about. Moments like this really motivate me to keep growing!\" (Calvin's side in the Music section of /memories/calvin.md) [S28T3][S28T4][S28T5][S28T6][S28T7]. Dave then said \"Wow, Calvin, imagining how your music affects others must be incredible! Keep up the great work!\" and, in the same message, announced he recently started a blog on car mods — \"It's my way to share my passion with others\" — and asked Calvin for blogging tips (unanswered in this excerpt), sharing a photo of a car website design (\"Just take a look at this beautiful car!\" — details in the Car mod blog section of this file) [S28T8]. The conversation continued: Calvin asked whether the blog had any success stories of inspiring others yet, and Dave said it's awesome that \"people are checking out my blog and asking me for advice,\" and that his recent post about how he made his car \"look like a beast\" was great because it \"inspired others to start their own DIY projects\" (shared a photo of a blue Subaru parked in a parking lot); Calvin: \"Wow, Dave! Your blog is awesome. Helping others get creative is awesome. Keep up the great work!\"; Dave: it's \"fulfilling to share my knowledge and help others unleash their creativity\"; Calvin: \"Yeah Dave, keep doing what you do! Your blog and car mods are inspiring and a great way to help people find their creativity.\"; Dave: the car mod \"was a lot of work, but I think it was worth it in the end\" (re-shared the photo of the blue Subaru); Calvin: \"Wow Dave, those headlights look great! What did you do to get them looking so good?\"; Dave: he \"spent a lot of time cleaning, polishing, and protecting them - they look great!\" (shared a photo of a blue car parked on a road at night — \"these headlights are enchanting!\") (details in the Car mod blog and Classic cars sections of this file; Calvin's side in the 2023-11-02 entry of the Relationships section of /memories/calvin.md) [S28T9][S28T10][S28T11][S28T12][S28T13][S28T14][S28T15][S28T16]. The conversation continued: Calvin: \"Wow, they look great! You really put in a lot of effort. Well done!\"; Dave: \"Thanks, Calvin! Really appreciate you noticing the effort I put into this.\" and shared a photo of a red car (a red car with a black engine and a red hood); Calvin: \"Thanks! Where did you get this car?\"; Dave: he \"found it last week\" (~late October 2023), \"it was in bad shape, but I saw the potential,\" and he \"spent ages restoring it\"; Calvin: \"Wow, Dave, that is an awesome job on restoring it! You've got some serious skills!\"; Dave: \"Thanks Calvin! It took some work, but I'm happy with the result. Take a look at the logo we created for our rock band!\" (shared a photo of a guitar logo with the company band logo); Calvin: \"Cool logo, Dave! What's the story behind it?\"; Dave: \"Cool! It's the logo for my rock band. I've been a fan for ages and have had the opportunity to join them\" (the red car in the Classic cars section; the logo in the Rock band section of this file; Calvin's side in the 2023-11-02 entry of the Relationships section of /memories/calvin.md) [S28T17][S28T18][S28T19][S28T20][S28T21][S28T22][S28T23][S28T24]. The chat then turned to music: Calvin: \"Wow Dave! Music really has a way of touching our souls.\" [S28T25]; Dave: \"Yeah, Calvin! It's amazing how music can really move us. It's almost like a language for our souls.\" [S28T26]. Calvin said the connection is what he's aiming for with his music, and shared a photo of his studio setup (a recording studio with a monitor, keyboard, and monitor); Dave: \"Wow, your studio looks stunning! How do you like hanging out here? Do you watch much TV?\" [S28T27][S28T28]. Calvin: he only works in the studio — he has a separate room for relaxation with a TV (a living room with a couch, chair, television and a table) — \"It's a great way to unwind and get inspired.\" [S28T29]. Dave: \"Wow, nice setup! What do you usually watch on it?\" [S28T30]. Calvin: music videos, concerts, and documentaries about artists and their creative process — \"It's cool to learn more about the industry and see what others do. Plus, it's a source of inspiration for me.\" (Calvin's side in the Music and Recording studio sections of /memories/calvin.md) [S28T31]. The chat closed with Dave: \"Wow, Calvin, that's awesome! Keep up the great work! Take a look at the photo!\" — sharing a photo of a notebook with a pen and a notepad on it [S28T32]. The conversation continued: Calvin thanked Dave (\"Thanks, Dave! Appreciate the support!\") and asked whether the notebook helps him stay connected to the creative process (\"Does this notebook help you stay connected to the creative process?\"); Dave: \"Yes, Calvin, writing lyrics and notes - that's awesome! It will boost my motivation! Writing lyrics boosts my motivation to grow!\" — he writes lyrics and notes, and writing lyrics boosts his motivation to grow — and shared a photo of a Pink Floyd headphone sitting on a shelf (details in the Music section of this file) [S28T33][S28T34]. Calvin: \"Cool, Dave! These really help you stay focused when making music.\" [S28T35]. Dave: \"Cool, Calvin! Music really helps me focus and be productive. When I'm doing my car stuff, I listen to vinyl to relax and stay on track.\" (details in the Music section of this file) [S28T36]. Calvin: \"Rockin' it, Dave! Music can definitely affect our mood and help us stay on track. Keep it up!\" [S28T37]. Dave: \"Thanks, Calvin! Music really helps with car work. Keeps me focused and makes it feel great.\" — and shared a photo of his record player (a record player sitting on the floor next to a couch): a bit old, but \"still gets the job done\" (details in the Music section of this file) [S28T38]. Calvin: \"Cool, Dave! What tunes are you listening to these days?\" [S28T39]. Dave: \"Lately, I've been getting into classic rock. The music from that era is timeless.\" (details in the Music section of this file) [S28T40]. The chat closed with Calvin: \"Cool, Dave! Classic rock has had a huge effect on music. Keep discovering!\"; Dave: \"Thanks, Calvin! Classic rock has had a huge impact on music. Always fun to dig in and find new tunes. Gotta go back to work, see you soon! Take care!\"; Calvin: \"Yeah, Dave! Exploring different styles and times can open up new perspectives. Broadening your musical knowledge is awesome. Good luck with work, see ya!\" (the closing message came with a photo of a record player sitting on the floor next to a couch — Dave's record player, see the Music section of this file) [S28T41][S28T42][S28T43].","text_sha256":"9940b97311e36185c677f13a31d5238cd985c53048ed4012d86aebb31cd58294","timestamp":"2023-11-02T17:46:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":1199,"filesystem_tool_calls":3,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":3,"prompt_tokens":130819,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":132018},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"56a7ee328b702acf677218605c2d649afe0089eda09165e5aadb286969116965","filesystem_tools_sha256":"6d9d68f047917d20adb9133168d5726233c9719dbefd54627e08827832d963c6","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3506af86ae75acd7ce07f88bae7a25e1bfec56a5b1c9f44abd3d71a2e6f4eb2d","paper_prompt_id":"filesystem-appendix-a3-prompt-5-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"de03315ff999a8bcea7e08a10866f3a6dc74badf690d23a036e35c74ff81335c"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"What type of music has Dave been getting into lately?","question_id":"conv-50-q147","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-extension20-v2","run_position":1,"schema_version":1},"question_sha256":"84b3f317b944b9bde4b2b456c8b078b9c3b756357370afad2b7efabc29400e8d","runtime_contract":{"evidence_budget_limit":16000,"evidence_budget_unit":"characters","round_limit":40,"runtime_sha256":"a217e40af4a88841d2e56d9a339e309008